<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady -- USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active.  Early sales both classes steady. - USDA</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  Load and part load Choice predominantly 3 1150-1450 lbs 67.25. High Select and Choice 2-3 1200-1400 lbs 64.00-66.00.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: High Select and Choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs scarce, few 64.00-64.50.</p>
</text>
